From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bas Nieuwenhuizen <bas@basnieuwenhuizen.nl>
Date: Fri, 14 Jan 2022 15:58:45 +0100
Subject: STEAMOS: radv: min image count override for FH5

Otherwise in combination with the vblank time reservation in
gamescope the game could get stuck in low power states.
---
 src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf b/src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf
index add51ece24a8..989e4476b209 100644
--- a/src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf
+++ b/src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf
@@ -346,6 +346,10 @@ Application bugs worked around in this file:
             <option name="radv_zero_vram" value="true"/>
         </application>
 
+        <application name="Forza Horizon 5" application_name_match="ForzaHorizon5.exe">
+            <option name="vk_x11_override_min_image_count" value="4" />
+        </application>
+
         <application name="No Man's Sky" application_name_match="No Man's Sky">
             <option name="radv_app_layer" value="no_mans_sky" />
         </application>

From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Pitoiset <samuel.pitoiset@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Jun 2026 14:11:29 +0200
Subject: STEAMOS: radv: enable radv_vm_explicit_sync for Forza Horizon 4

It's likely also affected but it's unverified.

Signed-off-by: Samuel Pitoiset <samuel.pitoiset@gmail.com>
---
 src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf b/src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf
index 989e4476b209..b2a4cf8b1d6d 100644
--- a/src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf
+++ b/src/util/00-radv-defaults.conf
@@ -259,6 +259,11 @@ Application bugs worked around in this file:
             <option name="radv_gfx12_hiz_wa" value="partial" />
         </application>
 
+        <application name="Forza Horizon 4" application_name_match="ForzaHorizon4.exe">
+            <!-- Use explicit sync to mitigate stutters in gameplay -->
+            <option name="radv_vm_explicit_sync" value="true" />
+        </application>
+
         <application name="Forza Horizon 5" application_name_match="ForzaHorizon5.exe">
             <!-- The full WA hurts performance too much, use the partial one
                  that seems fine overall. -->

